{"hw":"ἀποδημία","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀποδημία</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀποδημ-ία</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ιη,</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">going</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">being abroad,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. ἐξ οἴκου</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.130</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.10</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. ποιεῖσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cri.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">52b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἔξω τῆς χώρας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">949e</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">950a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. ἡ εἰς Ὀλυμπίαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.30</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">περὶ τῆς ἀ. τῆς ἐκεῖ</span> as to my <b class=\"lex-tr\">life in</b> that <b class=\"lex-tr\">foreign land,</b> i.e. beyond the grave, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">61e</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">67c</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">41a</span> </span> (but in pl. of earthly life, as <b class=\"lex-tr\">exile from</b> heaven, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Porph.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Marc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5</span> </span>); <span class=\"gk\">ἐξ ἀποδημίας τινὸς προσῄει</span> from <b class=\"lex-tr\">a long journey,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.1.7</span> </span>.</div></div>"}